# =============================================================================# SCRIPT SYNC BACKUP KE GOOGLE DRIVE via rclone# Dijalankan otomatis oleh Windows Task Scheduler setiap hari jam 03:00# Pastikan rclone sudah dikonfigurasi terlebih dahulu (lihat PANDUAN-SETUP.md)# =============================================================================# --- Konfigurasi ---$RcloneRemote   = "gdrive"                          # Nama remote rclone (sesuai konfigurasi)$RemoteFolder   = "gdrive:simpeg-backup"            # Folder di Google Drive$LocalBackupDir = "C:\simpeg-backup"                # Folder backup lokal$RclonePath     = "C:\rclone\rclone.exe"            # Path rclone executable$LogFile        = "C:\simpeg-backup\logs\rclone.log"# --- Fungsi Logging ---function Write-Log {    param([string]$Message)    $timestamp = Get-Date -Format "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss"    $entry = "[$timestamp] $Message"    Write-Host $entry    Add-Content -Path $LogFile -Value $entry}# --- Cek rclone tersedia ---if (-not (Test-Path $RclonePath)) {    Write-Log "ERROR: rclone tidak ditemukan di $RclonePath"    Write-Log "Pastikan rclone sudah diinstall. Lihat PANDUAN-SETUP.md"    exit 1}Write-Log "============================================"Write-Log "Mulai sync backup ke Google Drive..."# --- Jalankan rclone sync ---& $RclonePath sync $LocalBackupDir $RemoteFolder `    --log-file $LogFile `    --log-level INFO `    --transfers 4 `    --checkers 8 `    --contimeout 60s `    --timeout 300s `    --retries 3 `    --low-level-retries 10 `    --stats 1mif ($LASTEXITCODE -eq 0) {    Write-Log "Sync ke Google Drive BERHASIL."} else {    Write-Log "ERROR: Sync ke Google Drive GAGAL dengan exit code $LASTEXITCODE"    exit 1}Write-Log "Sync selesai."Write-Log "============================================"